== Walkthrough ==

''[[Furtog Ogrebane]] is located at 73, 300, 15 in the skybox overlooking the Kaladim Warrior's Guild arena.''

You say, 'Hail, Furtog Ogrebane'

: Furtog Ogrebane says, 'Hail, mighty ______! Welcome to Stormguard Hall. I am Captain Furtog Ogrebane, only surviving descendant of the legendary Trondle Ogrebane, slayer of the [Mudtoes]. If you wish to serve the grand city of Kaladim, I urge you to speak with any of the trainers. Good day.'

'''Hand [[Furtog Ogrebane]] your [[Recruitment Letter]]'''

:: ''The Recruitment Letter reads:''

:: <code>The Stormguard are now recruiting. To join, give this note to Furtog Ogrebane. He will train you well.</code>

: Furtog Ogrebane says, 'Greetings, friend, and welcome to Stormguard Hall! I am Furtog Ogrebane, Captain of the Guard. We shall train you to be a fearless warrior, who will serve to protect King Kazon well. Here is your tunic.'

